      <body>
         <div type="transliteration" xml:lang="pal">
            <pb xml:id="pb-1r-trl"/>
            <ab xml:id="MP5650_trl-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trl-p1-l1"/>BYR(Ḥ) ʾrtwhšt (YW)M ʾš(t)ʾ(t?) W (YW)M ʾsmʾn _ _
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trl-p1-l2"/>(dyn)ḥwlʾmŠG(I___________d)ʾn(yʾt)X__ __ _
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trl-p1-l3"/> YHWWNt ʾpzwt _ _spʹ BYN YWM ʾsmʾn gwšnspkn?
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trl-p1-l4"/>MTʾmʾh(g)wšnspʹY(___šk)bwt____(dʾšn)______X
               <lb n="5" xml:id="trl-p1-l5"/> mtrʹʾt GBRʾ 14? BYN YWM ʾsmʾn (_ _ ḤS_ _ _ )
               <lb n="6" xml:id="trl-p1-l6"/>MTʾ____(šnbndkʹ)WBYNYWMʾsmʾn(___ XXIII)[
               <lb n="7" xml:id="trl-p1-l7"/>dyn_ _mt_ _ʾk ḤS _ (BYN YWM) ʾyltʹ [
               <lb n="8" xml:id="trl-p1-l8"/>ʾsmʾnWYWM____(t)WYWM(dyn)YḤB___Y[
               <lb n="9" xml:id="trl-p1-l9"/>]dʾnynʹ ( ?) W (YW)[M] ʾsmʾn W(YW)M w[
               <lb n="10" xml:id="trl-p1-l10"/>YMR[RWN]yt _ _ _ dʾnkrtʹ Y[
            </ab>
         </div>
         <div type="transcription" xml:lang="pal">
            <ab xml:id="MP5650_trc-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trc-p1-l1"/>Māh Ardwahišt, rōz Aštād ud rōz Asmān (...)
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trc-p1-l2"/>Dēnhurām jaw 1(.....)-dān jād 10 (....)
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trc-p1-l3"/>būd Abzūd (...)sp andar rōz Asmān Gušnaspagān
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trc-p1-l4"/>deh Māhgušnasp ī (...) škbūd (...) 10
               <lb n="5" xml:id="trc-p1-l5"/>Mihrād mard 14 andar rōz Asmān (...) may (...)
               <lb n="6" xml:id="trc-p1-l6"/>deh (... šn bandag) ud andar rōz Asmān (...23)[
               <lb n="7" xml:id="trc-p1-l7"/>Dēn (...) mad (...)āg may (...) andar rōz Ard[
               <lb n="8" xml:id="trc-p1-l8"/>Asmān ud rōz (...t) ud rōz (dēn) dād (...) ī [
               <lb n="9" xml:id="trc-p1-l9"/>]dānēn ud rōz Asmān ud rōz W[
               <lb n="10" xml:id="trc-p1-l10"/>]gōwēd (...)dāngerd ī
            </ab>
         </div>
         <div type="translation" xml:lang="en">
            <ab xml:id="MP5650_trans-p1">
               <lb n="1" xml:id="trans-p1-l1"/>Month Ardwahišt, day Aštād and day Asmān (...)
               <lb n="2" xml:id="trans-p1-l2"/>Dēnhurām barley 1 (...) measure 10 (....)
               <lb n="3" xml:id="trans-p1-l3"/>was Abzūd (...)sp on day Asmān Gušnaspagān
               <lb n="4" xml:id="trans-p1-l4"/>village Māhgušnasp son of (...)škbūd (...) 10
               <lb n="5" xml:id="trans-p1-l5"/>Mihrād 14 men on day Asmān (...) wine (...)
               <lb n="6" xml:id="trans-p1-l6"/>village (... šn bandag) and on day Asmān (...23)[
               <lb n="7" xml:id="trans-p1-l7"/>Dēn (...) mad (...)āg wine (...) on day Ard[
               <lb n="8" xml:id="trans-p1-l8"/>Asmān and day (...t) and day (Dēn) gave (...) of [
               <lb n="9" xml:id="trans-p1-l9"/>]dānēn and day Asmān and day W[
               <lb n="10" xml:id="trans-p1-l10"/>] says (...)dāngerd son of[
            </ab>
         </div>
      </body>
